WEBVTT

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.616
(Applause)

00:05:01.640 --> 00:05:03.080
It's a good question.

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:06.576
Around the world,

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.720
black girls are grappling
with this question.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:11.336
And around the world,

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:14.856
black girls are struggling to be seen,
working to be free

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:16.496
and fighting to be included

00:05:16.520 --> 00:05:19.920
in the landscape of promise
that a safe space to learn provides.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:24.056
In the US, little girls,
just past their toddler years,

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:26.800
are being arrested in classrooms
for having a tantrum.

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:30.496
Middle school girls are being
turned away from school